<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Dallas Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Dallas Semiconductor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday Dallas Semiconductor Corp and Highwoods Properties Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Dallas reported a fourth quarter net share of $0.37 against $0.36 for the same period the previous year.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also unavailable.</p>
</text>
